{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53761","headline":"济源上枉舒员外两篇因酬六韵 · 白居易","name":"济源上枉舒员外两篇因酬六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"歇手不判案，举头仍见山。\n虽来鞍马上，不离诗酒间。\n济源三临泛，王屋一登攀。\n犹嫌百里近，只得十日闲。\n明朝却归府，尘事如循环。\n犹听瑶华曲，稍开风土颜。\n（见《四部丛刊》影印那波道圆本《白氏文集》卷五二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}